WEBVTT

00:00:07.650 --> 00:00:11.660
A state of emergency has been declared
for the entire Suoh region.

00:00:11.660 --> 00:00:15.700
Please evacuate immediately
to the nearest shelter. I repeat...

00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:16.950
What's happening?

00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:19.830
Where are the security forces?

00:00:19.830 --> 00:00:23.250
They must know that we've returned.

00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:25.250
What is going on?

00:00:29.170 --> 00:00:31.050
They're hanging back.

00:00:31.050 --> 00:00:33.890
The NDF has us surrounded.

00:00:35.310 --> 00:00:38.770
It's strange that they'd
ambush you like this.

00:00:38.770 --> 00:00:41.900
It sure seems like
they're up to something.

00:00:41.900 --> 00:00:44.270
We'll just have to break through.

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:47.360
Then we head straight for OSF HQ.

00:00:48.820 --> 00:00:50.360
Isn't that...?

00:00:56.030 --> 00:00:57.700
You'll all end up like me!

00:00:57.700 --> 00:01:00.620
You're the ones who need
to be rehabilitated!

00:01:00.620 --> 00:01:01.750
Nagi!

00:01:01.750 --> 00:01:04.130
No, wait! Yuito!

00:01:04.130 --> 00:01:06.540
Hey, Yuito.

00:01:06.540 --> 00:01:08.670
I was hoping I'd find you.

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:10.760
Nagi. Don't tell me...

00:01:10.760 --> 00:01:16.180
That's right, Yuito.
Your opponent is right here.

00:01:17.810 --> 00:01:20.390
I will be the one to eliminate

00:01:20.390 --> 00:01:25.610
you worthless fools who defy
our great nation of New Himuka.

00:02:58.280 --> 00:03:02.280
Nagi Attacks

00:03:09.040 --> 00:03:12.000
Nagi! We don't have to fight!

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:13.760
We can escape together!

00:03:15.720 --> 00:03:18.300
We'll undo your
personality rehabilitation.

00:03:18.300 --> 00:03:21.180
There has to be a way!

00:03:21.180 --> 00:03:23.390
Have you lost your mind?!

00:03:23.390 --> 00:03:26.060
I've been looking forward to this.

00:03:26.060 --> 00:03:28.140
First, I'm gonna kill you.

00:03:28.140 --> 00:03:31.310
Then I'll rip your brain out of your head.

00:03:31.310 --> 00:03:32.820
His brain?

00:03:32.820 --> 00:03:34.650
Yuito.

00:03:34.650 --> 00:03:38.660
You'll do me a solid, won't you?

00:03:38.660 --> 00:03:40.870
All I'm asking for is...

00:03:40.870 --> 00:03:43.240
...your brain!

00:03:50.880 --> 00:03:52.460
Everyone okay?!

00:03:52.460 --> 00:03:54.300
Such power.

00:03:54.300 --> 00:04:01.010
He must have undergone some form
of psionic power enhancement.

00:04:02.970 --> 00:04:05.470
Damn it. I don't understand.

00:04:05.470 --> 00:04:07.180
Why is this happening?!

00:04:07.180 --> 00:04:09.640
We gotta fight?! That's our only choice?!

00:04:09.640 --> 00:04:13.480
Just stand there if you don't wanna fight!

00:04:13.480 --> 00:04:16.400
I'll free that head of yours
from your shoulders!

00:04:52.400 --> 00:04:54.110
Enough already, Nagi!

00:04:54.110 --> 00:04:56.610
I don't wanna fight you!

00:04:56.610 --> 00:04:59.490
In that case, lemme have your brain.

00:04:59.490 --> 00:05:02.070
What do you say, Yuito?

00:05:02.070 --> 00:05:04.820
I always wanted to join the OSF.

00:05:04.820 --> 00:05:10.580
But I was never scouted,
so I joined the training academy.

00:05:10.580 --> 00:05:15.880
Even though everyone else looked at me
different because I was a Sumeragi,

00:05:15.880 --> 00:05:19.800
you talked to me as if
I was like everyone else.

00:05:19.800 --> 00:05:23.430
We did lots of special training
on our days off, didn't we?

00:05:23.430 --> 00:05:26.100
We trained in our secret place.

00:05:26.100 --> 00:05:31.100
I was inducted into the OSF
thanks to you, Nagi.

00:05:31.100 --> 00:05:32.980
You saved me.

00:05:32.980 --> 00:05:36.110
That's why I want to save you!

00:05:36.110 --> 00:05:40.400
Really? In that case, roll over and die.

00:05:40.400 --> 00:05:44.110
Your death will save me.

00:05:44.110 --> 00:05:46.990
Your death will bring me happiness.

00:05:46.990 --> 00:05:50.040
I'll be able to keep serving New Himuka.

00:05:50.040 --> 00:05:51.290
Nagi!

00:05:51.290 --> 00:05:53.460
Now, die!

00:06:55.020 --> 00:06:56.770
That was a close one.

00:06:56.770 --> 00:06:59.480
Now, stay still.

00:06:59.480 --> 00:07:03.110
We don't wanna damage
that precious little brain of yours.

00:07:03.110 --> 00:07:07.660
So let's hurry up and chop
that head off your shoulders.

00:07:14.370 --> 00:07:20.040
That's right. This is the secret location
where we did our special training.

00:07:20.040 --> 00:07:24.130
You were the one who told me
you'd found a great place.

00:07:26.380 --> 00:07:30.760
You said you couldn't wait to grow up
and be popular with the ladies.

00:07:30.760 --> 00:07:34.980
And you wanted to be a badass
like Major General Karen.

00:07:34.980 --> 00:07:37.100
But you always clowned around.

00:07:37.100 --> 00:07:38.810
With that kind of attitude,

00:07:38.810 --> 00:07:42.730
you shouldn't have survived
the OSF's brutal training.

00:07:42.730 --> 00:07:45.690
Nagi, you really are...

00:07:46.780 --> 00:07:49.610
Y-Yuito?

00:07:49.610 --> 00:07:51.280
Yuito...

00:07:51.280 --> 00:07:52.870
I...

00:07:58.750 --> 00:08:01.420
I... I am...

00:08:02.540 --> 00:08:05.800
Kill, kill, kill!

00:08:05.800 --> 00:08:08.800
No! I-I can't take it anymore!

00:08:08.800 --> 00:08:11.720
Kill, kill, kill!

00:08:11.720 --> 00:08:15.720
No. I... I...

00:08:17.060 --> 00:08:19.640
I am going to kill you!

00:08:19.640 --> 00:08:20.980
Nagi.

00:08:25.030 --> 00:08:28.320
I remember. I really remember, Yuito.

00:08:28.320 --> 00:08:31.450
My skill scores were higher than yours.

00:08:33.120 --> 00:08:35.200
I'm gonna kill you!

00:08:35.200 --> 00:08:37.120
Die for the sake of New Himuka!

00:08:37.120 --> 00:08:37.950
Nagi?

00:08:37.950 --> 00:08:42.830
But when it came to written tests,
you always helped me study.

00:08:42.830 --> 00:08:45.550
Your brain! Give me your brain!

00:08:45.550 --> 00:08:46.500
Nagi!

00:08:46.500 --> 00:08:50.930
Yuito, you were sure popular
with our fellow female cadets.

00:08:50.930 --> 00:08:53.350
Why was it always you?!

00:08:54.930 --> 00:08:57.770
Die! Die! Die!

00:08:57.770 --> 00:09:01.810
Stop! I... I...

00:09:01.810 --> 00:09:03.230
Yuito!

00:09:11.700 --> 00:09:13.620
Oh, no. Nagi's brain, it's...

00:09:13.620 --> 00:09:14.820
Stop this! Nagi!

00:09:14.820 --> 00:09:16.950
If you keep using your power...!

00:09:16.950 --> 00:09:19.660
Stay out of this!

00:09:38.970 --> 00:09:40.560
Die, Yuito.

00:09:40.560 --> 00:09:44.150
I'm gonna kill you and take your brain!

00:09:45.690 --> 00:09:49.230
No, I won't do it!
Stop ordering me around!

00:09:59.950 --> 00:10:01.910
Nagi!

00:10:09.960 --> 00:10:11.380
Nagi!

00:10:35.280 --> 00:10:36.780
Nagi!

00:10:36.780 --> 00:10:38.450
Nagi!

00:10:40.580 --> 00:10:41.790
Hang in there!

00:10:41.790 --> 00:10:43.960
Nagi! Nagi!

00:10:45.670 --> 00:10:48.630
Yuito. I'm sorry.

00:10:49.630 --> 00:10:53.010
I don't even know who I am anymore.

00:10:53.010 --> 00:10:59.470
A voice keeps telling me to kill you,
but I don't want to fight.

00:10:59.470 --> 00:11:02.640
I hate being like this, and I'm scared.

00:11:02.640 --> 00:11:04.310
But I can't fight it.

00:11:04.310 --> 00:11:06.480
It's okay. I understand.

00:11:06.480 --> 00:11:11.110
I'm fine, so there's no need
to blame yourself.

00:11:11.110 --> 00:11:13.110
Yuito.

00:11:13.110 --> 00:11:15.740
You really are...

00:11:16.740 --> 00:11:21.530
Why did this have to happen to us?

00:11:21.530 --> 00:11:24.750
We finally achieved our dream
of joining the OSF,

00:11:24.750 --> 00:11:27.620
and we were assigned to Seto Platoon.

00:11:27.620 --> 00:11:32.050
I thought we'd keep on being
a couple of goofballs together.

00:11:32.050 --> 00:11:35.720
Oh, yeah, Commander Seto...

00:11:35.720 --> 00:11:38.130
I owe him an apology.

00:11:38.130 --> 00:11:42.470
But it's too late now, isn't it?

00:11:44.180 --> 00:11:49.230
I always thought that if I died,
it would be battling Others,

00:11:49.230 --> 00:11:51.860
and I'd go out in a blaze of glory.

00:11:51.860 --> 00:11:55.860
Then I, too, would be a hero.

00:11:55.860 --> 00:11:59.570
Where did I go wrong?

00:11:59.570 --> 00:12:01.450
Where, Yuito?

00:12:02.530 --> 00:12:09.420
If I'm gonna die, I'd at least like to
know what I should've done different.

00:12:15.840 --> 00:12:16.970
Nagi?

00:12:17.970 --> 00:12:18.970
Nagi?

00:12:19.970 --> 00:12:21.300
Nagi!

00:12:34.650 --> 00:12:38.320
You didn't do anything wrong.

00:12:38.320 --> 00:12:40.700
When I was feeling nervous,

00:12:40.700 --> 00:12:46.080
you said let's start by becoming
full-fledged OSF members.

00:12:46.080 --> 00:12:50.080
I said I wanted to save
as many people as I could,

00:12:50.080 --> 00:12:52.670
but I couldn't even save you.

00:12:52.670 --> 00:12:53.920
Forgive me.

00:12:56.880 --> 00:13:01.510
I swear I will avenge you.

00:13:03.180 --> 00:13:05.720
Nagi is...?!

00:13:05.720 --> 00:13:07.640
But...

00:13:08.770 --> 00:13:10.810
There's no time for sorrow.

00:13:10.810 --> 00:13:12.650
We good to go, Wataru?

00:13:12.650 --> 00:13:15.020
It's ready when you are.

00:13:15.020 --> 00:13:17.570
Okay, let's get started.

00:13:18.900 --> 00:13:20.200
Arashi?

00:13:20.200 --> 00:13:22.160
What are you up to?

00:13:22.160 --> 00:13:24.370
Would you be quiet?

00:13:24.370 --> 00:13:26.870
This isn't gonna be easy.

00:13:26.870 --> 00:13:29.870
But I gotta get it right for Nagi.

00:13:36.420 --> 00:13:38.880
No one tried to stop us.

00:13:38.880 --> 00:13:42.050
They must have had everyone leave.

00:13:42.050 --> 00:13:46.220
Chief Sumeragi is
the only one in that room.

00:13:50.270 --> 00:13:51.730
Kaito.

00:13:51.730 --> 00:13:53.350
You came.

00:13:53.350 --> 00:13:58.650
We're here to speak with Suoh's
top leadership about Seiran.

00:13:58.650 --> 00:14:01.320
But first, I want to ask you something.

00:14:01.320 --> 00:14:06.160
Was it you who forced Nagi to attack me?

00:14:06.160 --> 00:14:09.540
He turned out to be worthless.

00:14:09.540 --> 00:14:12.410
We did everything to enhance his powers,

00:14:12.410 --> 00:14:15.290
but I guess he wasn't
that powerful to begin with.

00:14:15.290 --> 00:14:18.630
How dare you say that!

00:14:18.630 --> 00:14:22.010
Why? Why did you do it?!

00:14:22.010 --> 00:14:24.590
Because of your power.

00:14:24.590 --> 00:14:28.430
Your brain has a special
form of gravikinesis,

00:14:28.430 --> 00:14:31.850
and we must have it.

00:14:31.850 --> 00:14:36.190
So Suoh is aware of Yuito's power.

00:14:36.190 --> 00:14:42.240
I thought you'd give up and listen
if I unleashed your friend on you.

00:14:42.240 --> 00:14:48.200
If you had obeyed government orders,
we wouldn't have had to resort to this!

00:14:49.660 --> 00:14:54.500
When you were branded a rebel,
you should've come begging for my help.

00:14:54.500 --> 00:14:57.080
The consequences wouldn't
have been so severe.

00:14:57.080 --> 00:14:59.210
You've always been like that!

00:14:59.210 --> 00:15:03.050
You make decisions on your
own and never take advice.

00:15:03.050 --> 00:15:06.720
You have no idea of what
it means to be a Sumeragi.

00:15:06.720 --> 00:15:09.640
That's why Father never told you.

00:15:09.640 --> 00:15:11.060
Told me what?!

00:15:11.060 --> 00:15:17.060
The Sumeragi family's duty is to fulfill
Yakumo Sumeragi's dearest wish.

00:15:17.060 --> 00:15:19.230
Yakumo Sumeragi's dearest wish?

00:15:20.650 --> 00:15:24.570
That is not for your ears.
I've said more than I should.

00:15:24.570 --> 00:15:28.530
Does it have to do with the moon?

00:15:28.530 --> 00:15:33.160
Yakumo Sumeragi was in the first group
to emigrate from there.

00:15:33.160 --> 00:15:37.870
I see. You learned things better
left alone while you were in Togetsu.

00:15:37.870 --> 00:15:41.210
That's what I wanted to ask you about.

00:15:41.210 --> 00:15:43.090
Togetsu will sacrifice our world--

00:15:43.090 --> 00:15:46.420
I don't care about Togetsu's ravings.

00:15:46.420 --> 00:15:49.510
You didn't let them brainwash you,
did you?

00:15:49.510 --> 00:15:52.010
If anyone's been brainwashed, it's you!

00:15:52.010 --> 00:15:55.600
We double-checked the story
we heard in Togetsu.

00:15:55.600 --> 00:15:57.600
Only then were we convinced.

00:15:57.600 --> 00:15:59.020
Enough!

00:15:59.020 --> 00:16:02.860
You know nothing of Yakumo
Sumeragi's lofty dream.

00:16:02.860 --> 00:16:07.150
Then enlighten us.
What exactly was his dream?

00:16:09.070 --> 00:16:14.450
You must know by now the moon's people
created the Extinction Belt.

00:16:14.450 --> 00:16:19.710
So I imagine you've realized what
a bunch of monstrous fiends they are.

00:16:19.710 --> 00:16:22.710
Upon founding New Himuka
after great hardship,

00:16:22.710 --> 00:16:24.750
Yakumo Sumeragi made a vow.

00:16:24.750 --> 00:16:27.920
It didn't matter if it was
carried out in his generation.

00:16:27.920 --> 00:16:32.180
He vowed to one day destroy the
Extinction Belt and attack the moon.

00:16:33.220 --> 00:16:36.310
We are carrying out
Yakumo Sumeragi's will.

00:16:36.310 --> 00:16:40.020
We must exact vengeance upon the moon.

00:16:40.020 --> 00:16:43.980
Vengeance? So that was
Yakumo's dearest wish?

00:16:43.980 --> 00:16:45.320
That's right.

00:16:45.320 --> 00:16:50.200
It is the will of our Founding Father
and the duty of the Sumeragi family.

00:16:50.200 --> 00:16:54.120
New Himuka exists for that very purpose.

00:16:54.120 --> 00:16:58.160
We will use your power
to move the Extinction Belt.

00:16:58.160 --> 00:17:02.830
It is time to open the way to the moon
and exact our vengeance.

00:17:02.830 --> 00:17:06.960
I don't have the power
to move the Extinction Belt!

00:17:06.960 --> 00:17:11.470
You can if we use the brains of
the entire nation connected via SAS.

00:17:13.300 --> 00:17:15.640
Even with civilian brains,

00:17:15.640 --> 00:17:22.230
brain function can be vastly expanded
by connecting tens of thousands together.

00:17:22.230 --> 00:17:26.230
And once we connect such a vast
number of brains to a psionics user,

00:17:26.230 --> 00:17:29.780
New Himuka's military might
can be increased exponentially.

00:17:29.780 --> 00:17:34.030
You're insane! Only psionics users
can withstand a SAS connection!

00:17:34.030 --> 00:17:36.080
They need not withstand it.

00:17:36.080 --> 00:17:40.500
All I care about is access
to their brains.

00:17:40.500 --> 00:17:42.750
I'm not a tool. Neither are the people!

00:17:42.750 --> 00:17:47.500
Isn't it wrong to exact vengeance
for an event 2,000 years ago?

00:17:47.500 --> 00:17:50.220
It is the will of Yakumo Sumeragi.

00:17:50.220 --> 00:17:55.050
You keep saying his name,
but his death is ancient history.

00:17:55.050 --> 00:17:57.970
Yakumo Sumeragi yet lives!

00:17:57.970 --> 00:17:59.600
He's alive?

00:17:59.600 --> 00:18:02.690
He sleeps in Suoh, deep underground.

00:18:02.690 --> 00:18:06.820
At this very moment, he slumbers
as he awaits his day of vengeance.

00:18:06.820 --> 00:18:09.110
Wait, are you saying he's in cold sleep?

00:18:09.110 --> 00:18:11.530
Just like Kagero was.

00:18:11.530 --> 00:18:14.160
It's time to man up, Yuito.

00:18:14.160 --> 00:18:18.290
This is something you must accept
as a member of the Sumeragi family.

00:18:18.290 --> 00:18:20.040
To hell with that.

00:18:20.040 --> 00:18:24.250
A 2,000-year tradition?
All because I was born a Sumeragi?

00:18:24.250 --> 00:18:26.130
I'm nothing like you.

00:18:26.130 --> 00:18:28.880
I want to seek out the truth on my own,

00:18:28.880 --> 00:18:31.800
and once I find it,
act based on my own decisions!

00:18:31.800 --> 00:18:33.880
You'll no longer be a Sumeragi!

00:18:33.880 --> 00:18:35.390
I don't care.

00:18:35.390 --> 00:18:38.720
I am who I am, even without
the Sumeragi name.

00:18:38.720 --> 00:18:41.600
Yuito, you are...

00:18:42.850 --> 00:18:46.650
You leave me no choice.
I will force you to obey.

00:18:46.650 --> 00:18:50.820
I wanted you to hear me out,
but it seems that's impossible.

00:18:50.820 --> 00:18:54.110
And I don't plan on being your prisoner.

00:18:57.870 --> 00:19:01.080
Don't you care what Father would think?

00:19:01.080 --> 00:19:02.910
I'm sorry about that.

00:19:02.910 --> 00:19:07.080
But I think Father would've understood.

00:19:15.800 --> 00:19:17.720
Looks like we have to fight.

00:19:36.200 --> 00:19:39.530
You just saved us, but that was reckless.

00:19:39.530 --> 00:19:41.240
Sorry.

00:19:41.240 --> 00:19:42.540
Yuito...

00:19:44.160 --> 00:19:46.870
I've got something important to tell you.

00:19:46.870 --> 00:19:48.960
Can you meet me over here?

00:19:50.920 --> 00:19:52.000
Huh?

00:19:52.000 --> 00:19:54.090
What did you just say?

00:19:54.090 --> 00:20:01.300
I'm saying that I captured the audio
and video from your chat with the chief.

00:20:01.300 --> 00:20:04.140
I hacked into the control system.

00:20:04.140 --> 00:20:05.230
Arashi!

00:20:05.230 --> 00:20:07.270
So then you really...

00:20:07.270 --> 00:20:10.060
Yep, but it wasn't easy.

00:20:10.060 --> 00:20:13.150
It was a huge risk,
and I won't get another chance.

00:20:13.150 --> 00:20:18.030
But the data should prove useful
in that plan Fubuki hatched.

00:20:18.030 --> 00:20:22.580
I'll use Arahabaki to transfer
those images to the entire nation.

00:20:22.580 --> 00:20:27.750
The pass for Arahabaki.
It will output a one-time passcode.

00:20:27.750 --> 00:20:30.250
We haven't heard from
Major General Fubuki.

00:20:30.250 --> 00:20:31.460
You think he's okay?

00:20:31.460 --> 00:20:34.380
He won't kick the bucket that easy.

00:20:34.380 --> 00:20:37.300
Transfer the video to the whole nation...

00:20:37.300 --> 00:20:39.090
But if we do that...

00:20:39.090 --> 00:20:43.010
Yuito, I respect your decision
as a commander.

00:20:43.010 --> 00:20:45.810
And I'm ready to face whatever happens.

00:20:45.810 --> 00:20:48.180
After all, we're a team.

00:20:48.180 --> 00:20:50.350
I know it's a difficult decision.

00:20:50.350 --> 00:20:53.820
But we're all prepared for what happens,
just like Gemma.

00:20:56.110 --> 00:20:57.900
Thanks, everyone.

00:20:57.900 --> 00:21:01.780
But should I destroy what my father
and brother tried to protect?

00:21:01.780 --> 00:21:03.950
Is that the right choice?

00:21:03.950 --> 00:21:07.330
Honestly, I'm really conflicted.

00:21:07.330 --> 00:21:10.040
But now that I've learned the truth,

00:21:10.040 --> 00:21:11.630
I must act.

00:21:11.630 --> 00:21:14.500
This is something I have to do.

00:21:14.500 --> 00:21:16.170
Let's head for Arahabaki.

00:21:16.170 --> 00:21:18.880
And let's tell the people the truth

00:21:18.880 --> 00:21:22.800
that my brother and the government
have been hiding.

00:21:22.800 --> 00:21:26.930
Let's leave Suoh to Yuito and his platoon.
We've our own work to do.

00:21:26.930 --> 00:21:31.440
How do you plan on persuading
Seiran's top leadership?

00:21:31.440 --> 00:21:34.110
Why not try talking to Karen first?

00:21:34.110 --> 00:21:35.570
Our regiment commander?

00:21:35.570 --> 00:21:39.360
I wonder if he'd even give us
the time of day.

00:21:39.360 --> 00:21:41.950
Even so, we have to try.

00:21:42.950 --> 00:21:44.570
Kasane! Everyone!

00:21:44.570 --> 00:21:46.490
Haruka, what's wrong?

00:21:46.490 --> 00:21:49.540
Something's up at the Supernatural Life
Research Facility.

00:21:49.540 --> 00:21:53.250
They are moving the human-derived Others.

00:21:53.250 --> 00:21:54.460
Why?

00:21:54.460 --> 00:21:55.590
I don't know.

00:21:55.590 --> 00:21:59.670
But I took a look at the transfer data.

00:21:59.670 --> 00:22:02.430
It says Major General Fubuki is in charge!

00:22:02.430 --> 00:22:04.260
My brother?

00:24:08.710 --> 00:24:12.010
Naomi and Alice
